The release bundles QSMxT 10.0.0 unmodified, as published by the QSMxT
project with SHA256SUMS:
https://github.com/QSMxT/QSMxT/releases/tag/v10.0.0
Source: https://github.com/QSMxT/QSMxT/tree/v10.0.0
QSMxT is GPL-3.0-only (LICENSE). It is built on qsm-core v0.39.0
(https://github.com/astewartau/QSM.rs/tree/v0.39.0). The browser instead pins
qsm-core commit 95be94b83b43e80329b4ecfe8a74cf8114ea927a through qsmxt-engine;
its compatibility with the published native release is measured, not inferred
from an identical core version.
The browser's exact engine/core commits and the native compatibility measurement
are recorded in validation/browser-reference.json. qsmxt.json pins each archive's SHA-256.

QSMxT's archives include dcm2niix (https://github.com/rordenlab/dcm2niix);
its license is in app/native/dcm2niix.LICENSE.

Deep-learning weights are not included. They are downloaded on first use from
the Hugging Face repository qsmxt/qsm-onnx-weights at the commit pinned in
model.manifest.json; each model keeps its authors' license.
